  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WOO cares</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Good Works Initiaive B.V. (GWI) has successfully launched a collection of premium home fragrances and handmade candles on the Benelux market. These products are produced by small suppliers from poor and marginalized communities. This DGGF loan allows the GWI to establish a production and assembly location in Vietnam and to expand on several European and Asian markets. Next to the jobs that are created in the production facility and the local sales office, the investment also creates additional employment and income for the small suppliers that work with GWI.</narrative>
  </description>
